# L §3.2 Back to money: "A money def ... must be money. A num CUR becomes money only through round(x, u, mode)
# ... or through prorata"; money × num → num CUR; L §8.3 LOAD-UNIT "a num CUR stored as money".
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "a source"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit EUR: currency minor 0.01
unit hour "godzina"

input a: money PLN
input x: num

def b: money PLN at reader
  rule base = a * x
=== expect
refused: LOAD-UNIT ...
